{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Welcome to Dockside Dreams!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/c1876002eab0354a7c59b99d79de37a0.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this relaxing life simulation set in a peaceful seaside town, build your own dockside restaurant and make your dreams come true. Grab your fishing rod, cast it off the pier or the shore, and enrich your menus with the fresh catches you reel in. From fish sandwiches to octopus dishes, prepare a wide variety of recipes and keep your customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Fish and Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different rods to fish along the shores surrounding the town, discover new species, and expand your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/dcad2b306a00847f35e30d3f139ed4ab.poster.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1018 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/dcad2b306a00847f35e30d3f139ed4ab.webm?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/dcad2b306a00847f35e30d3f139ed4ab.mp4?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Prepare Perfect Menus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise seasoning and cleaning methods for each fish, strive to create perfect dishes. Complement your menus with appetizers and salads to make them even more special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/20eab34c3558091f68e85024f1967b62.poster.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1018 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/20eab34c3558091f68e85024f1967b62.webm?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/20eab34c3558091f68e85024f1967b62.mp4?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/4beee42b30809c4399c1e3ec52e704a4.poster.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1018 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/4beee42b30809c4399c1e3ec52e704a4.webm?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/4beee42b30809c4399c1e3ec52e704a4.mp4?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Customize Your Restaurant</strong><br>Spend your earnings to decorate your restaurant, purchase new equipment, and grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/5225a94aa2589e96cb60cf9a6fd29eab.poster.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1018 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/5225a94aa2589e96cb60cf9a6fd29eab.webm?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/5225a94aa2589e96cb60cf9a6fd29eab.mp4?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/29e8ebfc73ac57959d9915d814aec83d.poster.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1018 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/29e8ebfc73ac57959d9915d814aec83d.webm?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/29e8ebfc73ac57959d9915d814aec83d.mp4?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Interact with the Townsfolk and Your Friends</strong><br>Trade with the people living in this seaside town, and in multiplayer mode, run your restaurant together with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/378796ff92f9a6fa929242cc28d428f1.poster.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1018 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/378796ff92f9a6fa929242cc28d428f1.webm?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/378796ff92f9a6fa929242cc28d428f1.mp4?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dockside Dreams</strong> combines fishing, cooking, and management mechanics into one experience \u2014 perfect for anyone who wants to build their own cozy restaurant in a relaxing seaside atmosphere.</p>","ba