b_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Fish and Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different rods to fish along the shores surrounding the town, discover new species, and expand your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/dcad2b306a00847f35e30d3f139ed4ab.poster.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1018 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/dcad2b306a00847f35e30d3f139ed4ab.webm?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/dcad2b306a00847f35e30d3f139ed4ab.mp4?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Prepare Perfect Menus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise seasoning and cleaning methods for each fish, strive to create perfect dishes. Complement your menus with appetizers and salads to make them even more special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/20eab34c3558091f68e85024f1967b62.poster.avif?t=1761923546\" width=1018 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/20eab34c3558091f68e85024f1967b62.webm?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/20eab34c3558091f68e85024f1967b62.mp4?t=1761923546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://